rooms_desc ({"As you walk into this room the elegance of Melrin's home is seen.  Torchesbrightly light up this space.  Plush carpets made of Sabre-Tooth Tigerfur stretch from wall-to-wall.  Several mystical portals can be seen, leading to a variety of locations.","This Hallway connects the Grand Enterance to other rooms in the house.  It islit up with many torches, and has plush carpets on the floor.","As you pass through the door from the Grand Enterance, the smell of rosesand lilacs waft through the air.  From this, one can tell they haveentered the Garden.  The environment is a peaceful one, and could be usedto rest or a variety of other activities.  In the center of the Gardenthere is a fountain.  Near it is a bench, and a sign is near the western door","This outdoor shrine is dedicated to the deeds of Akira, once Warriorto the Vagabonds, mentor to Melrin, and now Wizard of the MUD.  Thisarea is surrounded by a strange aura, which is created by the enormousstatue near the altar.  His presence can be sensed by all who enter.","This room is filled with books...everything about every topic possible.There is very comfortable furniture ranging from a leather couch to adesk where the Master does his research to several tables and chairsfor general studies.  The room is well kept...despite the amount of booksin it.","South here of the Garden is a huge lake.  Its waters are calmly flowingeasternly and makes a swooshing noise as it moves.  Overhead, you seeseveral seagulls flying overhead, diving into the water to catch a fishin its mouth.  To the west, a beautiful sunset can be seen, very tranquilsight to be seen.","This room is the armoury of Melrin, Guild Warrior of the Vagabonds.You may leave weapons, armour, scrolls, etc that you may need for later adventuring.","This is the ante chamber to Melrin's Bedroom.  It is heavily decorated withvarious animal heads, furs, kegs (he killed these himself), and bottlesof liquor.  To the north is the door to Melrin's Bedroom...step in (onlyif you are female and a willing partner).","This room is obviously the bathroom...In the middle of the room there is a huge tube like object.  The water is heated, and you can note steam comingoff of the water.  Around it are candles lit and there are various bottlesof ointments, bath oils, etc ready to be used.","This room is a fully functional babe trap.  There is a bed in the middle of the room (king size of course) covered in silk sheets.In the background you can faintly hear Depeche Mode's ONE CARESS playing.A fire glows warmly from a fireplace built into the eastern wall.",})
rooms_short ({"Grand Enterance","Hallway","Garden","Shrine to Akira, Wizard of the MUD","Study","Lake with Sunset","Armoury","Ante Chamber","Bathroom","Bedroom",})
