items ({0,0,({"bench","An ordinary marble bench","fountain","A fountain with a statue of Venus, Roman goddess of Love","sign","Sign pointing west saying \"To Shrine of Akira, Warrior of Vagabonds\"",}),({"statue","A platinum statue of Akira Vagabond Warrior standing over Gorgurack","altar","A Cedarwood altar with a living virgin awaiting the arrival of Akira",}),({"desk","The Master's private desk...stay away from it, please?","couch","A leather couch with several throw pillows and an afghan on it","table","A table with a neat pile of books and scrolls on it awaiting reshelving",}),0,0,0,0,({"table","A table near the bed.  On it are a dozen red roses and a bottle of wine","fireplace","A fireplace glowing and warming the room, definitely romantic","bed","The bed is covered with silk sheets and plenty of pillows",}),})
